cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pricecast: synthetic hourly electricity price years for prospective energy system studies"
abstract: >-
  Generates a full year of hourly day-ahead electricity prices in one shot from
  load, solar and wind generation, by a regression fitted on recent years, as an
  input to LP and MILP design studies. The shape of the year comes from the
  model and its level from an outside fuel-and-carbon scenario. Ships models for
  five European bidding zones and the tools to build a future year: driver
  scaling, a gas-plant level anchor, an extrapolation check and a floor.
type: software
